{
  "info": {
    "name": "MariaDB Mock API 10.11",
    "description": "Test collection for the mock MariaDB HTTP service. Base URL defaults to http://localhost:8111. In docker-compose, the service is reachable at http://mariadb-api:8111. Statements are executed by a real SQL engine. MariaDB-specific behaviour modelled here: sequences (NEXT VALUE FOR, NEXTVAL, LASTVAL, SETVAL), RETURNING on INSERT and DELETE but not UPDATE, and the non-transactional Aria engine backing page_views, whose writes survive a rolled-back transaction. The X-MariaDB-User header selects the account: root (all privileges), forum_app (default), forum_mod, forum_analytics (SELECT on page_views, threads, categories only), forum_import (locked).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8111"
    }
  ],
